      "description": {
        "content": "The Proxy web service is used for managing a pool of Single-Use Accounts (SUAs) linked to a proxy. With this web service, you can create proxy pool(s) for a buyer, update details of the proxy, delete unused pools and get details about an existing pool(e.g. number of available accounts).",
